    "body": "In order to prepare for the GDPR we will ...\r\n\r\n- [x] ... stop saving nationality and gender;\r\n- [x] ... send an e-mail twice a year with the current contact details and ask if the user wants to update them;\r\n- [x] ... remove the user provided study history;\r\n- [x] ... persistently save the study (history) provided by the UT.\r\n\r\nWhen done, we also need to update the privacy policy.\r\n  ",
